  triage:description "REQ-SAG-0133 is Active and r-4 is its sole closing sprint. Its acceptance row 'req:REQ-SAG-0133 ... bead + upstream issue URL recorded' is deferred to the owner for a later docs commit. The sprint is nevertheless marked 'status: complete'. The ADR-SAG-0017 amendment and docs/development/sc-publish.md still say 'not yet filed'. The requirement row at docs/requirements.md:162 carries the qualifier 'upstream sc-publish issue URL pending', which means the requirement is not met as written. A requirement cannot be waived or deferred inside a review. Choose one of two routes. (a) Have the owner file the randlee/sc-publish issue, record the URL in the ADR-SAG-0017 r-4 amendment and docs/development/sc-publish.md, and remove the 'pending' qualifier from docs/requirements.md:162 before this PR merges. (b) Edit REQ-SAG-0133 and the r-4 acceptance row through a planned, reviewed requirements change, so the URL is not part of the requirement, and amend the sprint doc to match. partially-compliant" ;
